usage: demo.py [-h] [--question QUESTION] [--system {a0,best,both}]
               [--data-dir DATA_DIR] [--model-path MODEL_PATH]
               [--recover-names]

Interactive comparison of A0 and the validation-selected neural system.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --question QUESTION
  --system {a0,best,both}
  --data-dir DATA_DIR   Processed data directory for A0 only.
  --model-path MODEL_PATH
                        A0 model.pkl from a personal or acceptance run.
  --recover-names       Restore unambiguous tokenizer-damaged names from
                        retrieved facts; retain raw output.
